Strategy what the brand refuses to do
title end

paragraph start
A refusal list protects the brand when money tempts. Each refusal has a short reason so it can be defended later.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
never promote a product that was not used
never hide a sponsored or affiliate post
never publish unchecked news as fact
never copy another creator
never make medical promises
code end

